{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29759","headline":"射鱼曲 · 李商隐","name":"射鱼曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"思牢弩箭磨青石，绣额蛮渠三虎力。\n寻潮背日伺泅鳞，贝阙夜移鲸失色。\n纤纤粉簳馨香饵，绿鸭回塘养龙水。\n含冰汉语远於天，何由回作金盘死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}